<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk.Web">

    <PropertyGroup>
        <TargetFramework>net9.0</TargetFramework>
        <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
        <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
        <IsPackable>false</IsPackable>

        <!--
        AOT smoke test #8 (GH-4825): the POLECAT-backed HTTP lane, the SQL Server twin of
        Wolverine.AotSmoke.Marten.

        The failures GH-4825 reported were found through Marten, but two of the three are in Wolverine
        itself and reach any store that returns side effects from a handler or an endpoint:
        SideEffectPolicy losing the Execute metadata of an op interface (IPolecatOp here, IMartenOp
        there), and HttpChain closing its own Applier<T> over a Results<Ok<T>, ProblemHttpResult> return
        type. A lane per store is what keeps a fix proven on one from silently not covering the others.

        ⚠️ NOT RUN BY CIAotSmoke YET, and it would fail if it were. Polecat's DocumentStore constructor
        builds a provider for JasperFx's DeadLetterEvent, and DocumentMapping.BuildRawIdAccessors closes
        RawIdAccessors<DeadLetterEvent, Guid> with MethodInfo.MakeGenericMethod. GH-4805 measured that no
        rooting mechanism makes ILC generate code for a VALUE-TYPE instantiation, so nothing in this
        repository can reach it: today no Polecat application can be published with PublishAot at all,
        with or without Wolverine. Tracked upstream as JasperFx/polecat#733, which this lane independently
        confirmed. This project is committed, built with the solution and held to the
        codegen drift gate so it cannot rot, and CIAotSmoke carries the one commented line that turns it
        on once Polecat ships that fix.

        Needs the sqlserver service from docker-compose.yml (SQL Server 2025, port 1434).

        Refresh the committed pre-gen FROM THIS PROJECT'S DIRECTORY, with SQL Server running:

          dotnet run -f net9.0 codegen write
        -->
        <PublishAot>true</PublishAot>
        <StripSymbols>false</StripSymbols>
        <InvariantGlobalization>true</InvariantGlobalization>

        <!-- Runtime behaviour of a native image is what this asserts; mirrors the other native lanes. -->
        <SuppressTrimAnalysisWarnings>true</SuppressTrimAnalysisWarnings>
        <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);IL2026;IL2046;IL2055;IL2065;IL2067;IL2070;IL2072;IL2075;IL2087;IL2090;IL2091;IL2104;IL2111;IL3000;IL3050;IL3051;IL3053</NoWarn>
    </PropertyGroup>

    <ItemGroup>
        <ProjectReference Include="..\..\Http\Wolverine.Http.Polecat\Wolverine.Http.Polecat.csproj" />
    </ItemGroup>

    <ItemGroup>
        <!-- The one place that knows this repo's SQL Server is on 1434, and the WOLVERINE_SQLSERVER
             override each parallelized CI worker lane sets. Dependency-free, so it links in unchanged. -->
        <Compile Include="..\..\Servers.cs">
            <Link>Servers.cs</Link>
        </Compile>
    </ItemGroup>

</Project>
